.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# Secrets. The API key lives here locally and in GitHub Actions secrets in CI.
# Never in the repo: this one is published under an institution's name.
.env
.env.*

# Rendered output — rebuilt from data on every deploy.
site/

# The database IS committed (spec §8). Not because it is reviewable — it is
# not — but because it is the pipeline's memory: what has already been seen,
# how many items each source returned on each of its last runs, and the
# documents a batch submitted yesterday will be collected against tomorrow.
# None of that is re-derivable from a fresh checkout, and a daily job that
# starts empty re-fetches everything and can never notice a feed going quiet.
#
# What a human reviews is data/claims.json. That separation is what made
# committing the binary acceptable again.
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
backfill.log
